      "title": "Career Center",
      "description": "Career Center | Recruitment Facebook LinkedIn Email X Copy URL If you are unable to complete this application due to a disability, contact this employer to ask for an accommodation or an alternative application process. Math Course Assistants-SW Student Delaware, OH, US Today Requisition ID: 1910 Apply Student Worker – Math Course Assistants Number of Openings: 1 Purpose/Objective of the Role: Assist Instructor with course-related tasks to support student learning. Tasks & Responsibilities: Complete tasks related to student learning, material retention, assessment, etc. as directed. Qualifications: Math Major (Junior or Senior) Potential Future Career Benefit: Experience with assessing the work of others Experience completing work within a deadline NOTE: Employment sponsorship is not available for this position. Applicants must be currently authorized to work in the United States. Application Instructions : Complete the ADP application by selecting \"Apply\" button and answer all questions. Supervisor: Craig Jackson Commitment: 5 hours per week Term: Fall 2026 only Back Apply Copyright © 2026, ADP, Inc. All rights reserved. Powered by Privacy | Legal | Requirements | Artificial Intelligence To manage your preferences, click here Powered by Please switch to a supported browser listed here ,\n      or some features may not work correctly. Our site uses cookies and similar technologies to remember your visit, collect statistics of visits and tailor our site to your interests. They also enable to offer tailored advertising and to link to social networks. For more information or to set your cookie preferences, you may at any time use our tool « Cookie Preferences » at the bottom of our site. Cookie Privacy Statement Set your preferences Deny Agree and proceed Opt-Out Request Honored Set your cookie preferences ADP values your privacy. We provide you with this intuitive tool to help you understand what information may be collected by cookies, by whom