      "title": "Career Center",
      "description": "Career Center | Recruitment Facebook LinkedIn Email X Copy URL If you are unable to complete this application due to a disability, contact this employer to ask for an accommodation or an alternative application process. World Languages and Cultures-SW Student Delaware, OH, US 7 days ago Requisition ID: 1897 Apply Student Worker - World Languages and Cultures Number of Openings: 1 Purpose/Objective of the Role: Assisting the World Languages and Cultures faculty and academic assistant with office tasks. Tasks & Responsibilities: The World Languages and Cultures department is looking for a student worker to help around the office and assist the faculty and academic assistant with creating displays, retrieving mail, organizing office supplies, and creating promotional materials for the department. This position has up to 3 hours per week. Qualifications/Skills: Effective Communication Skills Attention to Detail Flexibility and Adaptability Punctuality and Time Management Strong Organizational Skills Creativity and design skills (e.g. pamphlets, flyers, bulletin boards) Potential Future Career Benefit: Collaboration Skills Project Management Project Design Professional Development Leadership Opportunities Networking NOTE: Employment sponsorship is not available for this position. Applicants must be currently authorized to work in the United States. Application Instructions : Complete the ADP application by selecting \"Apply\" button and answer all questions. Supervisor: Angelina Amato Commitment: up to 3 hours per week Term: Full Academic Year: Fall & Spring temporary, part-time position Back Apply Copyright © 2026, ADP, Inc. All rights reserved. Powered by Privacy | Legal | Requirements | Artificial Intelligence To manage your preferences, click here Powered by Please switch to a supported browser listed here ,\n      or some features may not work correctly. Our site uses cookies and similar technologies to remember your visit, collect statistics o