      "description": "Career Center | Recruitment Facebook LinkedIn Email X Copy URL If you are unable to complete this application due to a disability, contact this employer to ask for an accommodation or an alternative application process. French-SW Student Delaware, OH, US 7 days ago Requisition ID: 1896 Apply French-SW Number of Openings: 1 Purpose/Objective of the Role: Assisting the French teaching faculty with projects and promotional materials. Tasks & Responsibilities: French at OWU is seeking an assistant to help with such duties as social media updates, publicity for events, organization of materials as needed by Dr. Lewis Cusato, and other miscellaneous duties as needed. The ideal candidate is organized, loves the French language and francophone cultures, is able and willing to create compelling social media updates, and is highly enthusiastic about supporting French at OWU. Qualifications/Skills: Effective Communication Skills Attention to Detail Flexibility and Adaptability Punctuality and Time Management Strong Organizational Skills Creativity and design skills (e.g. pamphlets, flyers, bulletin boards) French Majors and Minors Preferred. Potential Future Career Benefit: Collaboration Skills Project Management Project Design Professional Development Leadership Opportunities Networking NOTE: Employment sponsorship is not available for this position. Applicants must be currently authorized to work in the United States Application Instructions : Complete the ADP application by selecting \"Apply\" button and answer all questions. Supervisor: Mary Anne Lewis Cusato Commitment: 3 hours per week , minimum wage Term: Full Academic Year (Fall 26 & Spring 27) Back Apply Copyright © 2026, ADP, Inc. All rights reserved. Powered by Privacy | Legal | Requirements | Artificial Intelligence To manage your preferences, click here Powered by Please switch to a supported browser listed here ,\n      or some features may not work correctly. Our site uses cookies and simil