      "description": "Career Center | Recruitment Facebook LinkedIn Email X Copy URL If you are unable to complete this application due to a disability, contact this employer to ask for an accommodation or an alternative application process. Gen Chem 110 Lab Assistant Student Delaware, OH, US 15 days ago Requisition ID: 1878 Apply Student Worker – General Chemistry 110 Lab Assistant Number of Openings: 1 Purpose/Objective of the Role: The Lab Assistant will provide support for students with accommodation requirements during Lab portions of the class. Tasks & Responsibilities: The Lab Assistant will attend labs and assist the student with various tasks, such as pouring and mixing ingredients, using microscopes, describing images, and other necessary tasks to facilitate the student's participation. This position does not require knowledge of class content but relies on strong communication skills to effectively support the student. Qualifications/Skills: Currently enrolled as a student at OWU. Strong attention to detail and organizational skills. Reliable and punctual with the ability to meet deadlines. Ability to handle confidential information with discretion and maintain professionalism. Sensitivity and understanding of the needs of students with disabilities. Willingness to provide support and assistance in an inclusive and respectful manner. Potential Future Career Benefit: Practice and develop strong communication skills Gain experience with improving the efficiency of processes Develop connections within our office, and with other offices around campus NOTE: Employment sponsorship is not available for this position. Applicants must be currently authorized to work in the United States. Application Instructions : Complete the ADP application by selecting \"Apply\" button and answer all questions. Supervisor: Nikki Byrd Commitment: 5-10 hours per week Term: Full Academic Year: Fall & Spring temporary, part-time position Back Apply Copyright © 2026, ADP, Inc. All r