      "title": "Career Center",
      "description": "Career Center | Recruitment Facebook LinkedIn Email X Copy URL If you are unable to complete this application due to a disability, contact this employer to ask for an accommodation or an alternative application process. GEOG 245 Tutor Grader-SW Student Delaware, OH, US 15 days ago Requisition ID: 1871 Apply GEOG 245 Tutor Grader-Student Worker Number of Openings: 1 Purpose/Objective of the Role: A grader and tutor is needed for the GEOG 245 course. Tasks & Responsibilities : The student will be tasked will collecting assignments Grading assignments Providing detailed feedback on assignments Tutoring (ideally 1-2 hours/week) Qualifications: Strong grade in GEOG 245 or A faculty recommendation on abilities to assess introductory-level earth science student work. Potential Future Career Benefit: Being detail-oriented Providing feedback Assessing both qualitative and quantitative information NOTE: Employment sponsorship is not available for this position. Applicants must be currently authorized to work in the United States. Application Instructions : Complete the ADP application by selecting \"Apply\" button and answer all questions. Supervisor: Nathan Rowley Commitment: 5 hours per week Term: Fall 2026 only , temporary, part-time position Back Apply Copyright © 2026, ADP, Inc. All rights reserved. Powered by Privacy | Legal | Requirements | Artificial Intelligence To manage your preferences, click here Powered by Please switch to a supported browser listed here ,\n      or some features may not work correctly. Our site uses cookies and similar technologies to remember your visit, collect statistics of visits and tailor our site to your interests. They also enable to offer tailored advertising and to link to social networks. For more information or to set your cookie preferences, you may at any time use our tool « Cookie Preferences » at the bottom of our site. Cookie Privacy Statement Set your preferences Deny Agree and proceed Opt-Out Request Hon