      "description": "Career Center | Recruitment Facebook LinkedIn Email X Copy URL If you are unable to complete this application due to a disability, contact this employer to ask for an accommodation or an alternative application process. Theatre Scene Shop-SW Student Delaware, OH, US 20 days ago Requisition ID: 1855 Apply Student Worker – Theatre Scene Shop Number of Openings: 12 Purpose/Objective of the Role: The Chappelear theatre scene shop worker assists with the construction, maintenance and strike of the theatrical sets, lights and props. This position provides hands on experience with carpentry, painting, welding and technical theatre. The worker will also assist in keeping an organized and safe working environment. Tasks & Responsibilities : Set construction using power tools for both wood and metal work Paint scenic elements as needed Maintain a clean and organized shop, following safety protocols set by the Technical Director Qualifications: Interest in learning how to use power tools Ability to lift up to 50 lbs and work in a physically active environment Ability to work in teams and independently as needed Potential Future Career Benefit: This job provides valuable hands-on experience in building and fabrication that is highly desired in technical theatre and well beyond. There are also many opportunities to develop critical thinking and problem-solving skills that will be critical in any managerial position. NOTE: Employment sponsorship is not available for this position. Applicants must be currently authorized to work in the United States. Application Instructions : Complete the ADP application by selecting \"Apply\" button and answer all questions. Supervisor: Carrie Hurst Commitment: 0 to 20 hours per week Term: Full Academic Year - (Fall26 - Spring 27) temporary, part-time position Back Apply Copyright © 2026, ADP, Inc. All rights reserved. Powered by Privacy | Legal | Requirements | Artificial Intelligence To manage your preferences, click here