      "title": "Career Center",
      "description": "Career Center | Recruitment Facebook LinkedIn Email X Copy URL If you are unable to complete this application due to a disability, contact this employer to ask for an accommodation or an alternative application process. Peer Mentor-SW Student Delaware, OH, US 27 days ago Requisition ID: 1841 Apply Peer Mentor-Student Worker Number of Openings: 10 Purpose/Objective of the Role: Support first-year students in the Bishop ACCESS program. Important – Rehire Position Only: This position is only open to students who previously held this position and are being rehired for Fall 2026. We are not accepting applications from new candidates. Tasks & Responsibilities: Meet with first-year students throughout the semester. Attend weekly meetings. Qualifications/Skills: Previously worked in this position during Spring 2026. Enrolled in Bishop ACCESS for Fall 2026. Previously interviewed with Julia Brooker and Emily Hanafin in April 2026. Selected and approved for rehire by Julia Brooker and Emily Hanafin. Please do not apply if you are a new candidate. This posting is for rehires only. NOTE: Employment sponsorship is not available for this position. Applicants must be currently authorized to work in the United States. Application Instructions : Complete the ADP application by selecting \"Apply\" button and answer all questions. Supervisor: Emily Lugg Commitment: 2 hours per week Term: Fall and Spring - temporary, part-time position Back Apply Copyright © 2026, ADP, Inc. All rights reserved. Powered by Privacy | Legal | Requirements | Artificial Intelligence To manage your preferences, click here Powered by Please switch to a supported browser listed here ,\n      or some features may not work correctly. Our site uses cookies and similar technologies to remember your visit, collect statistics of visits and tailor our site to your interests. They also enable to offer tailored advertising and to link to social networks. For more information or to set your cookie 